CONTEXT Registry IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Registry
{+ A register of persons that refers to the context Towns without stating the inclusion.
The file that includes this context states it. See shouldSucceed/graph_in_main_file.adl. +}

RELATION name[Person*Name] [UNI,TOT]
RELATION residence[Person*Towns.Town] [UNI]

POPULATION name[Person*Name] CONTAINS [ ("p1", "Peter") ]
POPULATION residence[Person*Towns.Town] CONTAINS [ ("p1", "Enschede") ]

ENDCONTEXT
